[00:09.29] I fell out of heaven
[00:13.45] To be with you in hell
[00:17.98] My sin's not quite seven
[00:22.70] Nothing much to tell
[00:27.16] Lust I haven't craved
[00:31.55] A saintly boy I'm not
[00:36.05] I'll take it to my grave
[00:40.45] A side cursed on rot
[00:44.92] 
[01:03.05] I ride these roads alone
[01:07.28] Beneath the sulfur sky
[01:12.24] Everywhere I roam
[01:16.42] Life is one big lie
[01:20.37] When the fireball goes down
[01:25.53] Out by L.A. ways
[01:29.82] I come into town
[01:34.05] But only for a day
[01:39.01] 
[02:14.97] Starving in bad means
[02:19.18] I pray for you to understand
[02:23.70] A man sure is weak
[02:28.18] But lust holds my hand
[02:32.52] I struggled and I cried
[02:37.02] I pounced with no avail
[02:41.49] At least I never lied
[02:45.49] Or did the truth derail
[02:50.91] 